{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちぴーなっつ(´｡•_•｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前ね、\nのぎえいごの公開収録してきたよ｡\nすごい面白かった～～！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OA楽しみにしててね꒰⌯͒•·̫•⌯͒꒱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/12/03/7137293/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑ひらりーｻﾝと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/12/03/7137293/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度いっしょにお出かけするのです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/12/03/7137293/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/12/03/7137293/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お料理したよ～珍しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オムライスとカプレーゼ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/12/03/7137293/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おうちの残ってた野菜達で\nレシピ見ずに思いつきで挑戦してみた←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初挑戦だたけど\n卵やぶけなかったし、\nけっこう美味しく出来たんだ～꒰๑•௰•๑꒱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしすごいって\nひとりでなった（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またなんか今度挑戦してみよ～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何作ってほしい～？( ⸝⸝･໐･⸝⸝ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バスソルトいれて半身浴したいきぶん｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さむい時期になると、\nバスソルト大量にストックおいといて\n毎日お風呂つかる( ⸝⸝･໐･⸝⸝ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの寒いとこから帰ってきて\nすぐお風呂つかったら\nジーンとくる感じが好きです。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/12/03/7137293/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/12/03/7137293/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな風邪ひかんように\nあったかくして寝なね～おやすみ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/12/03/7137293/0005.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}